WEBVTT

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:14.210
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.240
No, not at all.

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:17.530
Well then, let's go.

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:19.030
Okay.

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:52.460
Summer festival!?

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:55.420
Yep, there's a fun summer festival tonight.

00:01:55.420 --> 00:01:59.430
I see! There must be a Bad Item there!

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:00.880
Really?

00:02:00.880 --> 00:02:03.640
I can't be wrong. Take me with you!

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:06.150
I'm very suspicious of you!

00:02:06.150 --> 00:02:07.800
About what?

00:02:07.800 --> 00:02:11.710
It's not like I want go to see the beautiful ladies in yukatas...

00:02:11.710 --> 00:02:15.120
Or to see their beautiful legs underneath the flaps of the kimonos...

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:17.060
I didn't say any of that!

00:02:17.060 --> 00:02:17.610
Oh crap.

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:20.570
Idiot. You're so hopeless.

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:22.500
What an idiot.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:27.930
Then if we do see anything suspicious, we'll take it back to you to look over it.

00:02:27.930 --> 00:02:28.240
Hey wait!

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:30.290
See you later.
Hey wait!

00:02:32.940 --> 00:02:36.710
In any case, will magic goods sell during the festival?

00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:38.730
It's not a case of whether or not they'll sell.

00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:40.180
They WILL sell.

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:42.510
Don't worry, leave it to me.

00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:45.000
I have a good plan already.

00:02:48.300 --> 00:02:51.150
By the way, Doremi, what are you making?

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:53.180
It looks pretty good, right?

00:02:53.180 --> 00:02:55.260
Yes! What a marvelous eggplant!

00:02:55.680 --> 00:03:00.400
Jeez, Majo Rika, that's definitely a carrot.

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:03.590
Yer both wrong, she ain't makin' anything like that.

00:03:03.590 --> 00:03:06.950
That must be... Uh...

00:03:07.350 --> 00:03:09.160
It's a pineapple!

00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:12.790
Yeah, yeah, that's right.

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:14.960
It does look like a pineapple...

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:29.240
The Tap that Disappeared at the Festival!

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:44.370
Be Careful of Pickpockets - Misora Police

00:03:45.150 --> 00:03:46.310
Come one, come all!

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:49.040
Sisters, brothers, gramps and grandma!

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:51.730
This is the magic goods darts game!

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:54.040
Why don'tcha try yer luck?

00:03:55.910 --> 00:03:58.520
SOS! Good timing!

00:03:58.520 --> 00:03:59.510
Come try it!

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:02.970
I didn't think business would be this good.

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:08.140
Using a darts game to win magic goods, that's a pretty interesting idea.

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:10.870
It's my idea, after all.

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:14.170
In any case, you just copied what you saw on TV the other day.

00:04:23.690 --> 00:04:25.870
I'm sorry, but you didn't win anything.

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:29.100
What a failure, puripuri puri!

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:31.370
Well then, it's my turn next.

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:48.130
Sweet!

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:51.270
Don't be so happy when you've only got a #3 prize!

00:04:58.430 --> 00:05:00.320
Mimi, yer turnin' it too slow!

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:04.550
This ain't gonna work.

00:05:04.550 --> 00:05:06.260
Switch with someone else now!

00:05:18.010 --> 00:05:20.520
Oh? Is this darts?

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:23.990
At your standards, this is a pretty good idea.

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:28.350
However, you all probably don't know how this is done, so let me show you.

00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:31.970
You see, playing darts is all in the wrist.

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:51.280
Wow!

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:53.040
Congratulations!

00:05:54.510 --> 00:05:57.160
Doremi, let me try too!

00:05:57.160 --> 00:05:59.830
Okay, one try is 10 yen.

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:13.310
Hit For Magic Goods

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:18.160
So sorry!

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:20.650
That was pretty bad, not even hittin' the board.

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:24.870
Ah! Hey, hey!

00:06:24.870 --> 00:06:28.860
I heard that there's a pickpocket running around.

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:29.970
Pickpocket?

00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:31.820
Like the ones who steal purses?

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:36.370
Yes, and they only target beautiful women.

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:39.870
You all don't have to worry, but I sure am.

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:41.920
I think one thing's for sure.

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:44.550
Doremi is definitely fine, because...

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:47.000
That's enough out of you!

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:50.010
Okay, everyone, choose your favorite magic item.

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:52.240
Did you make all of these?

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:53.470
Yes.

00:06:54.300 --> 00:06:57.680
None of them seem to be made very well...

00:06:58.240 --> 00:06:59.470
Yeah...

00:07:00.990 --> 00:07:02.860
Well... I'll take this one.

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:03.860
Later.

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:06.770
She chose the best one.

00:07:06.770 --> 00:07:09.840
Hadzuki-chan, what spell did you put on that?

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:12.040
A spell that makes everyone like you.

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:15.730
That's the most suitable one for Tamaki then.

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:19.320
I want this one!

00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:21.340
Then I want this one!

00:07:21.340 --> 00:07:23.850
I want this one!

00:07:23.850 --> 00:07:25.460
Excuse us!

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:28.820
They're so funny, even while choosing their items!

00:07:28.820 --> 00:07:30.280
Wow!

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:31.180
You what now?

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:32.670
Then I want...

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:37.230
What? Only Doremi's goods are left?

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:39.910
How do you know they're mine?

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:41.890
Isn't it obvious? You can tell just by looking.

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:45.210
You're right.

00:07:45.210 --> 00:07:47.710
No one wants mine.

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:49.940
Is there magic on this one too?

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:55.350
Of course, you'll have very good luck if you wear it!

00:07:55.350 --> 00:07:57.030
Does this really work?

00:07:57.710 --> 00:07:59.210
I'm not sure.

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:02.440
Oh well, I'll choose this one.

00:08:02.440 --> 00:08:05.880
Since only Doremi's goods are left, business won't go well for you from now on.

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:09.500
Kotake!

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:11.320
Later.

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:13.220
Hey!

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:15.620
Jeeeeez!

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:24.720
Hey, hey, Ai-chan, Hadzuki-chan.

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:28.390
What's up?

00:08:28.390 --> 00:08:29.040
That.

00:08:32.600 --> 00:08:34.380
Ah, ain't that Yuki-sensei?

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:37.280
Is that guy she's with...

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:39.820
Yuki-sensei's boyfriend?

00:08:39.820 --> 00:08:40.520
What!?

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:42.500
Yuki-sensei has a boyfriend?

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:48.750
We promised to introduce each other to our boyfriends if we ever got one!

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:52.250
Let's go.

00:08:52.250 --> 00:08:53.010
Okay.

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:53.960
Alright!

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:54.820
Hey!

00:08:54.820 --> 00:08:57.260
Who'll look after the stand!?

00:08:57.260 --> 00:08:59.070
Pop, it's in your hands now!

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:02.390
Okay, leave it to me!

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:05.270
Jeez, those three...

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:06.850
Come, welcome, welcome!

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:09.230
Ah, it's Pop-chan!

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:10.260
What are you doing?

00:09:10.260 --> 00:09:11.410
I'm manning a stand.

00:09:11.410 --> 00:09:12.330
Would you like to buy something?

00:09:12.330 --> 00:09:14.030
This is so cute!

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:17.530
We're not playing house here...

00:09:18.730 --> 00:09:20.650
Ah, it's Plush-chan!

00:09:23.090 --> 00:09:24.910
This is the worst.

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:27.370
Shaved Ice

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:52.240
They seem to be having fun.

00:09:59.070 --> 00:10:01.390
Yuki-sensei's purse!

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:03.850
That's dangerous!

00:10:03.850 --> 00:10:07.270
It's like she's askin' fer a pickpocket to come.

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:10.150
Yeah.

00:10:10.150 --> 00:10:11.710
Let's go warn her.

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:19.090
Hey you!

00:10:22.380 --> 00:10:23.680
Harukaze.

00:10:24.210 --> 00:10:25.040
Are you okay?

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:28.100
I was robbed!

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:33.450
My wallet was stolen!

00:10:34.350 --> 00:10:37.030
Don't tell me that person from just earlier stole it!?

00:10:37.660 --> 00:10:39.800
Harukaze, are you all right?

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:41.450
Did he steal anything?

00:10:43.920 --> 00:10:45.260
My wallet is still here.

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:50.960
It's gone... No way!

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:53.420
Don't tell me he did steal something?

00:10:54.900 --> 00:10:57.070
N-No... I'm fine.

00:10:57.070 --> 00:11:00.890
Either way, teacher, you should call the police right now.

00:11:00.890 --> 00:11:03.720
You're right. I'll go right now.

00:11:07.590 --> 00:11:10.560
What should I do, Ai-chan, Hadzuki-chan?

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:12.120
What's wrong, Doremi-chan?

00:11:12.120 --> 00:11:13.270
What happened?

00:11:14.450 --> 00:11:15.980
My Tap is gone!

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:20.450
What should I do...

00:12:05.140 --> 00:12:07.160
You idiot!

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:09.870
You let a pickpocket take your Tap?

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:14.040
In all my 800 years I've <i>never</i>  seen someone so stupid!

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:16.540
Jeez, what were you doing!?

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:21.220
But why would a pickpocket target a child like Doremi?

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:24.100
Oh! That's it!

00:12:24.100 --> 00:12:26.600
That pickpocket targets beautiful women!

00:12:28.240 --> 00:12:33.040
I see... I am a world-renowned beautiful girl...

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:35.700
Stop standing around feeling embarrassed, you Ojamajo!

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:37.650
Go get your Tap back right this minute!

00:12:40.100 --> 00:12:41.380
How 'bout it, Doremi-chan?

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:43.060
Do ya see the pickpocket?

00:12:43.060 --> 00:12:46.160
It's impossible to find him among so many people.

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:48.350
Ah, over there!

00:12:48.350 --> 00:12:49.080
Eh, where?

00:12:49.820 --> 00:12:51.080
Yuki-sensei and her boyfriend!

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:53.760
What, it's only them?

00:12:53.760 --> 00:12:56.540
Hadzuki-chan, don't get me all excited.

00:12:59.830 --> 00:13:01.710
Will the pickpocket really show himself?

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:06.390
Of course, he won't let someone as pretty as you go by him.

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:15.640
He's here.

00:13:17.170 --> 00:13:17.940
Don't turn around.

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:18.860
Okay.

00:13:19.660 --> 00:13:21.920
I see him! Ai-chan, that's him!

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:22.520
Where?

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:27.870
Okay... Closer... Closer...

00:13:31.730 --> 00:13:36.370
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun!

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:41.350
Time, stop!

00:13:46.830 --> 00:13:48.010
My Tap, my Tap...

00:13:50.940 --> 00:13:52.390
My Tap...

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:54.470
Hurry up, there's no time left!

00:13:54.470 --> 00:13:56.060
It's no use hurrying me...

00:13:56.060 --> 00:13:57.870
Eh? It's not here?

00:13:59.760 --> 00:14:01.940
Hurry! There's no time left!

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:03.230
Doremi-chan, get back up here!

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:05.370
But my Tap...

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:06.260
Hurry!

00:14:08.100 --> 00:14:09.530
Yuki-sensei's purse!

00:14:11.270 --> 00:14:15.380
Stop! You're under arrest, you pickpocket!

00:14:16.980 --> 00:14:18.080
No waaaay!

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:20.570
Eh?

00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:21.380
Hey!

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:23.290
W-W-Who are you?

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:24.380
Harukaze-san!

00:14:26.180 --> 00:14:28.050
Good evening, Yuki-sensei.

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:30.000
Hey!

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:30.650
Wait!

00:14:31.860 --> 00:14:34.010
Teacher, who's that guy?

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:36.760
Actually, that man is...

00:14:41.470 --> 00:14:43.320
Are you okay, Harukaze-san?

00:14:44.490 --> 00:14:45.580
What's wrong?

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:48.640
Sorry, teacher, I just remembered I needed to do something.

00:14:48.640 --> 00:14:50.690
Well then, excuse me.

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:56.200
No way!

00:15:04.350 --> 00:15:05.980
Doremi-chan, get on!

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:10.140
Why is that dog wearing my clothes?

00:15:10.140 --> 00:15:14.100
I don't think Doremi-chan's Tap was stolen, but was dropped instead.

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:17.310
I see, so that's how the dog got it.

00:15:17.780 --> 00:15:20.390
I need to thank it for finding it for me.

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:22.500
But I need to get it back...

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:23.160
Found it!

00:15:24.260 --> 00:15:25.230
Over there!

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:28.660
Okay.

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:40.580
No way!

00:15:42.150 --> 00:15:46.590
Paipai Ponpoi Puwapuwa Puu!

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:50.470
Doremi-chan, turn into a dog!

00:15:54.650 --> 00:15:57.470
It's Doremi the loyal dog, nice job.

00:15:58.280 --> 00:15:59.880
Thank you, Hadzuki-chan.

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:03.820
Hey! Pickpocket!

00:16:05.420 --> 00:16:06.810
I hear someone over there!

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:16.780
No good, I can't catch up...

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:27.320
There's too many people!

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:32.710
Mary-chan, come back!

00:16:32.710 --> 00:16:34.010
Mary-chan!

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:36.140
Mary...

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:40.650
Oh my, who dressed you up in those clothes?

00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:44.440
Out of my way!

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:49.250
Mary!

00:16:49.250 --> 00:16:50.920
Mary-chan!

00:16:51.490 --> 00:16:55.200
Hey, hey, I can't catch up to a bike...

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:58.660
Okay, I'll let you run faster.

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:04.620
Paipai Ponpoi Puwapuwa Puu!

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:07.880
Turn into a horse!

00:17:13.120 --> 00:17:16.350
Darn it! How sly, escaping by bicycle!

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:23.230
What's a horse doing here?

00:17:27.200 --> 00:17:29.730
God hasn't forsaken me yet!

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:34.900
H-Hey! Why are you riding me?

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:36.280
Okay, go!

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:39.700
Why does it have to be like this?

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:43.590
I think it's gettin' even more complicated now.

00:17:43.590 --> 00:17:45.420
Go, Doremi-chan!

00:17:45.420 --> 00:17:46.420
Hey, hey...

00:17:50.300 --> 00:17:51.220
Wait!

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:59.610
I guess I'm still the world's unluckiest pretty girl.

00:17:59.610 --> 00:18:00.760
Now I'm a pony...

00:18:01.510 --> 00:18:04.180
Why is a horse chasing me?

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:15.840
Don't run!

00:18:17.180 --> 00:18:19.140
Wow, they're so stubborn...

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:25.000
I finally found you.

00:18:29.480 --> 00:18:31.460
Hey!

00:18:31.460 --> 00:18:33.380
No more...

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:35.250
What's wrong? Hang in there!

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:47.310
Mary-chan! Come back!

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:52.800
Where are you!?

00:18:52.800 --> 00:18:56.230
Where were you taken to, Mary!?

00:19:02.570 --> 00:19:04.220
My Tap!

00:19:14.160 --> 00:19:16.710
Mary-chan!

00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:24.240
Thank goodness, it's my Tap!

00:19:33.410 --> 00:19:34.820
Man, this thing...

00:19:38.880 --> 00:19:41.270
Idiot, get out of the way!

00:19:42.280 --> 00:19:44.570
Wait!

00:19:47.210 --> 00:19:49.030
Leave me alone!

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:53.100
Okay, that's as far as you go.

00:19:53.100 --> 00:19:55.040
You are under arrest for suspicion of being a pickpocket!

00:19:58.670 --> 00:20:00.760
A cop living next to you?

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:03.970
I'm Yamamoto, nice to meet you.

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:10.370
Actually, he wanted me to act in a couple's roleplay to catch the pickpocket.

00:20:10.370 --> 00:20:12.440
To catch the pickpocket?

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:16.230
Oh? I don't think it's that simple.

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:22.700
I think you're just making an excuse to have a date with Yuki-sensei, right?

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:34.460
Jeez, I can't rest with all this noise.

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:38.630
But thank goodness that she found her Tap.

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:40.510
What do you mean, "Thank goodness?"

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:43.240
That scare took a hundred years off my life!

00:20:44.390 --> 00:20:49.810
Everyone, summer vacation is almost over.

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:52.830
Did you all do your homework?

00:20:53.490 --> 00:20:55.170
Okay, calm down.

00:20:55.170 --> 00:20:59.270
Don't slack off too much just because it's summer.

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:03.990
Moreover, there is an excellent student here among you.

00:21:04.560 --> 00:21:07.790
Kotake Tetsuya-kun, please come up to the podium.

00:21:13.050 --> 00:21:15.080
Here, good job.

00:21:17.800 --> 00:21:20.550
You helped me get my wallet back.

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:21.920
Thank you, Kotake.

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:26.090
Well, I didn't do much...

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:28.970
Kotake's blushing!

00:21:28.970 --> 00:21:30.980
Why only Kotake?

00:21:30.980 --> 00:21:33.600
We did so much too!

00:21:33.600 --> 00:21:37.060
I think it's all thanks to Doremi-chan's magic item.

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:43.630
Yeah, yeah, we can profit off that, and Kotake looks so happy.

00:21:49.790 --> 00:21:50.670
You're right.

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:04.270
Yamauchi-kun's family runs a very old temple.

00:22:04.270 --> 00:22:06.840
Since it's so old, there's lotsa stories about it.

00:22:06.840 --> 00:22:07.940
Yes, they'll come out.

00:22:07.940 --> 00:22:08.890
C-Come out?

00:22:08.890 --> 00:22:09.720
What will?

00:22:09.720 --> 00:22:12.120
And with that, the last fun event of the summer!

00:22:12.120 --> 00:22:13.730
Ghost stories and tests of courage!

00:22:14.720 --> 00:22:17.030
If you go strolling in the cemetery at night...

00:22:17.030 --> 00:22:19.230
A real ghost may appear...

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:21.520
Maybe a real one will come out...

00:22:21.520 --> 00:22:23.740
A ghost!? No!

00:22:23.740 --> 00:22:25.060
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:25.060 --> 00:22:26.360
I Want to Meet the Ghost!

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:29.150
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
